// `` at the start of a line makes the whole line raw: one backtick is an
// inline raw, two a line, three a block. What follows is text, not syntax.

`` @name *not em* $(not.interp) // not a comment

// One space after the backticks is the separator; a second one is text.
``  indented once

// Consecutive lines are one block; a blank line ends it.
`` first
`` second
``
``third

// It breaks a paragraph, like a block does.
text
`` raw
